00:01:17.737 --> 00:01:18.904
She has a job.

00:01:19.744 --> 00:01:24.031
She's divorced from Devon,
and she's a grown woman.

00:01:24.031 --> 00:01:27.698
Raven Symone, I came
out, and I'm an artist,

00:01:29.254 --> 00:01:30.910
