00:04:52.996 --> 00:04:54.182
would have to be Devon,

00:04:54.182 --> 00:04:57.014
only because he was like my friend, too,

00:04:57.014 --> 00:04:59.430
and we were cool, and
we work together now,

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:01.309
