00:05:01.309 --> 00:05:05.145
He's cool peoples and he's not like weird.

00:05:05.145 --> 00:05:06.073
It's okay.

00:05:06.073 --> 00:05:07.533
I like him.

00:05:07.533 --> 00:05:10.027
(upbeat music)

00:05:10.027 --> 00:05:11.699
The cast member I was
closest with would be

00:05:11.699 --> 00:05:12.724
Anneliese van der Pol.

00:05:12.724 --> 00:05:14.065
We are still close today.

00:05:14.065 --> 00:05:15.896
We chilled even after the show ended.

00:05:15.896 --> 00:05:18.343
It was funny because,
like, I'm this person.

00:05:18.343 --> 00:05:19.445
I don't text you every day.

00:05:19.445 --> 00:05:20.557
I might not call you every day.

00:05:20.557 --> 00:05:23.507
You might hear from me
maybe like once a month.

00:05:23.507 --> 00:05:24.903
But that's because I'm working,

00:05:24.903 --> 00:05:27.784
that's 'cause I'm talking
to my mama half the time,

00:05:27.784 --> 00:05:29.555
and she understood that.

00:05:29.555 --> 00:05:32.962
So we always had tabs on each other.

00:05:32.962 --> 00:05:34.314
So I moved here and she called me.

00:05:34.314 --> 00:05:35.678
She was like, "You're moving to New York?"

00:05:35.678 --> 00:05:36.511
I'm like, "Yeah."

00:05:36.511 --> 00:05:37.726
She's like, "I'm already here."

00:05:37.726 --> 00:05:38.860
So we had our moment there.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:39.912
We went out a couple times.

00:05:39.912 --> 00:05:43.559
But we've always taken care
of each other on our off time.

00:05:43.559 --> 00:05:46.142
(upbeat music)

00:05:47.295 --> 00:05:49.603
I did not improvise that
much on That's So Raven

00:05:49.603 --> 00:05:51.006
in the beginning.

00:05:51.006 --> 00:05:53.462
As we all got comfortable
with who Raven Baxter was

00:05:53.462 --> 00:05:55.293
and I understood the guidelines

00:05:55.293 --> 00:05:57.353
of what I could and
could not say on Disney,

00:05:57.353 --> 00:06:01.463
there were ad libs such
as ya nasty and oh snap.

00:06:01.463 --> 00:06:05.112
As I go into Raven's Home, it's funny

00:06:05.112 --> 00:06:05.945
'cause I have to tell the kids,

00:06:05.945 --> 00:06:07.653
"You can't ad lib yet,"
and they're like, "Why?"

00:06:07.653 --> 00:06:08.486
I said, "I don't know.

00:06:08.486 --> 00:06:09.319
"It just is.

00:06:09.319 --> 00:06:10.403
"It works, I promise.

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.616
"I hated it too, but do it."

00:06:12.616 --> 00:06:14.165
So that's just how it is right now.

00:06:14.165 --> 00:06:16.492
It's fun and I'm trying
my best not to ad lib.

00:06:16.492 --> 00:06:18.271
They used to call me AW, As Written,

00:06:18.271 --> 00:06:19.903
because I just wouldn't do it.

00:06:19.903 --> 00:06:21.308
And now my memory is real bad.

00:06:21.308 --> 00:06:23.730
Oh, I feel so bad for them.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.442
I love you.

00:06:25.442 --> 00:06:28.025
(upbeat music)

00:06:28.881 --> 00:06:31.698
In playing a mother there's, you know,

00:06:31.698 --> 00:06:34.543
I have responsibilities and jobs to hold.

00:06:34.543 --> 00:06:35.650
And especially on Disney Channel

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.388
you're not gonna, you know,

00:06:37.388 --> 00:06:39.121
there's a big difference obviously

00:06:39.121 --> 00:06:41.741
because this is a kids' program for sure.

00:06:41.741 --> 00:06:44.521
This is about my twins,
this is about Chelsea's son

00:06:44.521 --> 00:06:46.144
and their next door neighbor

00:06:46.144 --> 00:06:47.953
and we just happen to be the parents,

00:06:47.953 --> 00:06:50.152
but we're still crazy.

00:06:50.152 --> 00:06:53.102
Like, we're still teenager-ish,
I guess we have to say,

00:06:53.102 --> 00:06:55.144
and Anneliese and I are
always checking each other

00:06:55.144 --> 00:06:56.853
saying, "We have to make
sure that we're a parent.

00:06:56.853 --> 00:06:58.479
"We have to make sure that
we're acting like parents,"

00:06:58.479 --> 00:07:02.646
because it's hard because
Raven and Chelsea, we're crazy.

00:07:03.863 --> 00:07:07.238
We have problems, even as adults.

00:07:07.238 --> 00:07:09.821
(upbeat music)

00:07:11.008 --> 00:07:12.188
How 'bout I do you one better.

00:07:12.188 --> 00:07:14.147
I remember the lyrics to my first song

00:07:14.147 --> 00:07:16.254
released on MCA records when I was five.

00:07:16.254 --> 00:07:17.372
Of course I remember the lyrics to

00:07:17.372 --> 00:07:19.040
That's So Raven theme song.

